   422	    /// Number of EM iterations actually run (≤ `em_iters`).
   423	    pub em_iters_run: usize,
   424	    /// Variational-covariance mode used in the E-step. `false` (default) is the
   425	    /// Laplace approximation (full ν = H⁻¹); `true` is the mean-field diagonal
   426	    /// approximation (ν = diag(1/H_ii), off-diagonals zero). Stored so
