  1770	    /// Golden parity guard: a frozen `fit_ctm` output on a fixed fixture, so the
  1771	    /// extraction into `topica-core` is provably a numerical no-op and `topica`
  1772	    /// (which re-exports this `fit_ctm`) stays in lock-step. Two fits from the same
